&lt;li&gt;Build a rapport with the teams at all levels both in operations and our support office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training on recruitment practices for all hiring managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills/Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
